foreignFields.description:
References the organization that owns the employee and timesheets in this weekly aggregation.

All timesheets aggregated in this record belong to employees within this organization. This enables organization-scoped dashboard queries and multi-tenant data isolation. When an organization is deleted, these statistics are cascadingly removed to maintain referential integrity.

{@link hrm_platform_organizations}

References the employee who owns the timesheets aggregated in this weekly record.

Each record represents timesheet activity for exactly one employee during one week. The employee must belong to the referenced organization. If the employee is deleted or deactivated, the weekly statistics are cascadingly removed to maintain data consistency.

{@link hrm_platform_employees}
